<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine 96 public sector surplus 2.12 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Philippine 96 public sector surplus 2.12 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine consolidated public sector position swung to a surplus of 2.12 billion pesos in 1996 from a deficit of 1.8 billion pesos in 1995, preliminary figures released by the Department of Finance on Friday showed.</p>
</text>
